{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","language":"zh-CN","entryId":"codex-light-cones","chapterId":"item-ItemConfigEquipment-23007","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23007-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23007-0","text":"虚无命途专属的光锥，光锥技能仅对该命途生效。","speaker":""},{"id":"codex-light-cones-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23007-item-ItemConfigEquipment-23007-1","text":"她走出屋檐下，打着伞哼着歌钻进小巷的角落。\n不多一会儿，雨声停了。\n\n她挠挠头，滑动屏幕，头上的一小片空间内，雨丝再次滑落。\n听着淅淅沥沥的雨声打落在伞面上，配合游戏的音效，她心情格外的好。\n「还是下雨天打游戏最痛快。」","speaker":""}]}
